@host = https://localhost:63202
# Mismos valores que SuperAdmin__Email y SuperAdmin__Password de tu archivo .env
@adminEmail = superadmin@example.com
@adminPassword = ChangeMe123

### Login (guarda el token automáticamente)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}

### Registro (rol ADMIN por defecto, devuelve { token, refreshToken, data })
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ana",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "Ana12345",
  "name": "Ana",
  "surname": "Perez"
}

### GET profile

GET {{host}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PUT profile
PUT {{host}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "name": "Super",
  "surname": "Admin"
}

### Cambiar contraseña (cierra todas tus sesiones; el super admin no puede: usa SuperAdmin__Password)
PATCH {{host}}/api/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Ana12345",
  "newPassword": "Ana54321",
  "confirmNewPassword": "Ana54321"
}

### Listar usuarios (requiere permiso users.read)
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh (repetirlo con el mismo token debe dar 401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}"
}

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}"
}

### ===== USERS =====

### Listar con filtros y orden
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=0&size=10&search=super&blocked=false&sort=email,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener uno
GET {{host}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear (rol 2 = ADMIN en la semilla; verifica con GET /api/roles. El rol SuperAdmin no se puede asignar)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luis",
  "email": "luis@example.com",
  "password": "Luis12345",
  "name": "Luis",
  "surname": "Gomez",
  "role": { "id": 2 }
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{host}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luis",
  "email": "luis@example.com",
  "name": "Luis",
  "surname": "Gomez",
  "blocked": false,
  "role": { "id": 2 }
}

### Eliminar (soft delete)
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restaurar usuario eliminado
PATCH {{host}}/api/users/2/restore
Authorization: ******

### ===== ROLES =====

### Listar
GET {{host}}/api/roles?page=0&size=20&search=&active=true&sort=name,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle (con permisos)
GET {{host}}/api/roles/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear
POST {{host}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Supervisor", "active": true, "permissions": [{ "id": 1 }] }

### Actualizar
PUT {{host}}/api/roles/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Supervisor", "active": true, "permissions": [{ "id": 1 }] }

### Asignar permisos (ids de GET /api/permissions)
PUT {{host}}/api/roles/3/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "permissionIds": [1] }

### Eliminar rol (falla con 409 si tiene usuarios)
DELETE {{host}}/api/roles/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restaurar rol eliminado
PATCH {{host}}/api/roles/3/restore
Authorization: ******

### ===== PERMISSIONS =====

### Actualizar título de permiso
PUT {{host}}/api/permissions/1
Authorization: ******
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Consultar usuarios" }

### Listar catálogo
GET {{host}}/api/permissions?page=0&size=30&search=users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
